<!-- WHAT'S INSIDE: sticky-note board -->
<section class="inside-section" id="inside">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="inside-board">
      <span class="board-tape board-tape-l" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="board-tape board-tape-r" aria-hidden="true"></span>

      <div class="board-head">
        <div>
          <span class="board-kicker">the whole recipe. no secrets.</span>
          <h2 class="board-title">what's <mark>inside</mark></h2>
        </div>
        <span class="board-stamp">7 ingredients<br>0 proprietary blends</span>
      </div>
      <p class="board-sub">every amount, per 10 g sachet. scribbled notes included 👇</p>

      <ul class="notes-grid">
      <li class="note note-yellow">
        <span class="note-tape" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="note-amt">3,000 mg</span>
        <h3 class="note-name">organic raw cacao</h3>
        <p class="note-why"><span>why it’s here →</span> the base. real dark chocolate, not “chocolate flavour”. the bit that makes this a treat 🍫</p>
        <p class="note-job"><b>the job:</b> makes bedtime something you actually look forward to.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="note note-pink">
        <span class="note-tape" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="note-amt">3,000 mg</span>
        <h3 class="note-name">glycine</h3>
        <p class="note-why"><span>why it’s here →</span> an amino acid your body already makes. tastes lightly sweet, which is a nice bonus.</p>
        <p class="note-job"><b>the job:</b> helps your body ease into wind-down mode.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="note note-mint">
        <span class="note-tape" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="note-amt">2,000 mg</span>
        <h3 class="note-name">magnesium L-threonate</h3>
        <p class="note-why"><span>why it’s here →</span> magnesium bound to threonate. the fancy form, and we’re not shy about the dose.</p>
        <p class="note-job"><b>the job:</b> the calm-mind magnesium.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="note note-lilac">
        <span class="note-tape" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="note-amt">1,000 mg</span>
        <h3 class="note-name">magnesium bisglycinate</h3>
        <p class="note-why"><span>why it’s here →</span> magnesium paired with glycine. we used two forms of magnesium, not one.</p>
        <p class="note-job"><b>the job:</b> the relaxed-body magnesium.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="note note-peach">
        <span class="note-tape" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="note-amt">500 mg</span>
        <h3 class="note-name">tart cherry extract</h3>
        <p class="note-why"><span>why it’s here →</span> from tart cherries. a little fruity edge hiding under the chocolate 🍒</p>
        <p class="note-job"><b>the job:</b> a natural night-time partner for the rest of the mix.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="note note-sky">
        <span class="note-tape" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="note-amt">200 mg</span>
        <h3 class="note-name">L-theanine</h3>
        <p class="note-why"><span>why it’s here →</span> found naturally in tea leaves. yes, the same stuff in your chai ☕</p>
        <p class="note-job"><b>the job:</b> calm, not drowsy. turns down the mental chatter.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="note note-lime">
        <span class="note-tape" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="note-amt">50 mg</span>
        <h3 class="note-name">apigenin</h3>
        <p class="note-why"><span>why it’s here →</span> a compound found in chamomile, the OG bedtime tea 🌼</p>
        <p class="note-job"><b>the job:</b> the chamomile cue that it’s time to switch off.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="note note-card">
        <span class="note-tape" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <h3 class="note-name">rules we made for ourselves</h3>
        <ul class="note-rules">
          <li>every amount on the label</li>
          <li>no proprietary blends</li>
          <li>no melatonin</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="note-why">full ingredient + allergen list is printed on the pack 📦</p>
      </li>
      </ul>

      <div class="board-goal">
        <span class="board-goal-kicker">🎯 the end goal</span>
        <p class="board-goal-title">one warm mug that tells your body <mark>it's bedtime.</mark></p>
        <ul class="board-goal-math">
          <li><b>🍫 cacao</b> makes it a ritual</li>
          <li class="op" aria-hidden="true">+</li>
          <li><b>🧘 glycine + 2× magnesium</b> help you unwind</li>
          <li class="op" aria-hidden="true">+</li>
          <li><b>🍵 L-theanine + 🌼 apigenin</b> help your mind switch off</li>
          <li class="op" aria-hidden="true">+</li>
          <li><b>🍒 tart cherry</b> rounds out the night</li>
          <li class="op" aria-hidden="true">=</li>
          <li class="res"><b>😴 drift off easier, wake up fresh</b></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Product: what's inside",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Product: what's inside"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
